  "prefLabel": "Gcd 214.06 Issuance and Publication of Declaratory Rulings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 214.06 Issuance and Publication of Declaratory Rulings. Declaratory rulings shall be edited as necessary to comply with RSA 91-A and filed on the day of issue with the director of legislative services in accordance with RSA 541-A:16, II (b).\n\nSource. #7635-A, eff 1-30-02; ss by #10339, eff 5-17-13",
